        ORDINANCE NO. ______________
AN ORDINANCE APPROPRIATING MONEYS FOR THE CITY OF CHEYENNE, WYOMING,
FOR THE VARIOUS PURPOSES IN CONDUCTING THE MUNICIPAL GOVERNMENT OF SAID
CITY AND FIXING THE AMOUNT OF GENERAL AND SPECIAL TAXES AS PART OF THE
REVENUE REQUIRED TO MEET THE SAID APPROPRIATION, ALL FOR THE FISCAL YEAR
BEGINNING JULY 1, 2023, AND ENDING JUNE 30, 2024.
BE IT ORDAINED BY THE GOVERNING BODY OF THE CITY OF CHEYENNE, WYOMING:
That the sum of one hundred seventy-one million, seven hundred and seventy-one thousand, one hundred and
twenty-seven dollars ($171,771,127) or so much thereof that may be necessary, and the same hereby is
appropriated for all funds of the City of Cheyenne, for the several specific departments, for the fiscal year
beginning July 1, 2023, and ending June 30, 2024, as follows:
Ice & Events Center
