FOOTNOTE 1: Per City Resolution 6191, a budget line item was created in the Community Recreation and
Events Administration Division budget in Fiscal Year 2023 named Lottery Proceeds Capital Expenditures in
the amount of $323,579. Per this resolution, lottery funds shall be earmarked for CRE capital expenditures.
Lottery proceeds have been estimated to be $400,000 in Fiscal Year 2024. A portion of these funds
($76,421) have been appropriated for one year to pay for an Arborist in the Community Recreation & Events
Forestry Division.
That there shall be raised by General Tax Levy on the total assessed valuation of the City of Cheyenne,
Wyoming for the fiscal year beginning July 1, 2023 and ending June 30, 2024, in accordance with State
Statutes:
General Fund (8.0 mills requested)
Providing that said amount does not exceed eight (8.0) mills on City assessed valuations as provided by law.
FOOTNOTES:
